{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Sokoku</strong> is a block-pushing game with a twist: you not only push blocks, you <i>are</i> one. Specifically, you are a die that rolls over itself, changing its top face with every move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/extras/move_demo.gif?t=1749062365\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll need to plan your path carefully so that all numbers end where they have to, including the one on top of yourself, while you interact with all kinds of cubes and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/extras/puzzle_completion.gif?t=1749062365\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of puzzles will test your logic, patience, and spatial thinking. Can you roll your way to the solution?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3397880?t=1749062365","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3397880?t=1749062365","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/48a0814e2ff26270a610539d0652e9af4fa1893b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749062365","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/48a0814e2ff26270a610539d0652e9af4fa1893b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749062365","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3579700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Sokoku</strong> is a block-pushing game with a twist: you not only push blocks, you <i>are</i> one. Specifically, you are a die that rolls over itself, changing its top face with every move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/extras/move_demo.gif?t=1749062365\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll need to plan your path carefully so that all numbers end where they have to, including the one on top of yourself, while you interact with all kinds of cubes and mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/extras/puzzle_completion.gif?t=1749062365\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dozens of puzzles will test your logic, patience, and spatial thinking. Can you roll your way to the solution?</p>","developers":["carllacan"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397880/0f9c2f920f4c9bdf87cdaa93d90c79dbcc96660c/header.jpg?t=1749062365","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Most Linux OS should work<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 2.00 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 3000<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130958,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130958/movie480.mp4?t=1745588878","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130958/movie_max.mp4?t=1745588878"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130958/3bdbb62a85fb2b651073a99b53148d5892f7e24a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1745588878","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steam